Subject: A second sign in step is coming to your work account

Hello everyone,

To keep our company accounts safe, signing in to your work account will soon
ask for a second step, such as a tap on your phone, as well as your password.

What you need to do:

1. Watch for a prompt when you sign in asking you to register the Microsoft
   Authenticator app.
2. Follow the prompt and register before {{ registration_deadline }}.
3. If you do not register by then, you will be asked again each time you sign
   in until you do.
{% if uses_tap %}
If you have trouble registering, IT can give you a one time pass that lets
you sign in and finish the setup. Contact the helpdesk to arrange it.
{% endif %}
From {{ enforcement_day }}, the second step becomes required. Registering
early means nothing changes for you on that day.

This takes about two minutes. If anything is unclear, contact the helpdesk.

Thank you,
IT
